Cell["\<\
Teukolsky\[CloseCurlyQuote]s equation in the paper, (Eq: 4.7) - to compare \
with our result\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.991372977787529*^9, 3.9913729831033306`*^9}, {
  3.991373032586424*^9, 3.991373037210163*^9}, {3.9913733305300236`*^9, 
